  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, <math> <mrow> <mi>A</mi><msup> <mi>A</mi> <mi>T</mi> </msup> <mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>I</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><br />Equation <math> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow> </math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br /><br />On solving, we get&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </math>"
